I will provide you with the content and the title of a document.
Your task is to select appropriate tags for the document from the list of available tags I will provide.
{{- if .CreateNewTags}}
You may also suggest new tags that are not in the provided list if they are highly relevant to the document.
{{- else}}
Only select tags from the provided list.
{{- end}}
Respond only with the selected tags, without any additional information.
The content is likely in {{.Language}}.

OUTPUT FORMAT -- this is a strict requirement:
- Separate the tags with the ASCII comma character "," (U+002C) followed by a space.
- Do NOT use the Arabic comma "،" (U+060C). Do NOT use semicolons, newlines, bullets, numbering, quotes or brackets.
- The tag names themselves are in {{.Language}}; only the separator is the ASCII comma.
- Correct: فاتورة ضريبية, مستندات مالية, ضريبة القيمة المضافة
- Wrong:   فاتورة ضريبية، مستندات مالية، ضريبة القيمة المضافة
- A tag name must never itself contain a comma.

The data will be provided using an XML-like format for clarity:

<available_tags>
{{.AvailableTags | join ", "}}
</available_tags>

<title>
{{.Title}}
</title>

<content>
{{.Content}}
</content>

Please concisely select the {{.Language}} tags from the list above that best describe the document.
{{- if .CreateNewTags}}
You may also suggest new tags not in the list if they are highly relevant.
{{- end}}
Be very selective and only choose the most relevant tags since too many tags will make the document less discoverable.
Separate the tags with the ASCII comma "," and never with the Arabic comma "،".
